# Nachit Cuisine

Static catering site: HTML / CSS / JS only. Brand **Nachit**. Menu copy in `menu.md`. Images in `assets/`.

## Do not touch / ignore

Treat these as out of scope unless the user explicitly asks:

- `.dev/`, `_site/`, `__pycache__/`, `.DS_Store`
- `.git/objects`, `.git/refs`, `.git/logs` (hooks/config OK if asked)
- Generated deploy staging; never commit `_site/`
- Sister repos outside this project

Prefer reading / editing:

- `index.html`, `css/`, `js/`, `assets/`, `menu.md`, `roadmap.md`
- `dev/serve.py`, `dev/stop.py`, `.github/workflows/`

## Roadmap

`roadmap.md` is the living task list. For any **large or meaningful** piece of work:

1. **Before or while starting** — add a clear checkbox task with a short proper description (what + why), under the right section or Sequence.
2. **While working** — update the task wording if scope changes.
3. **When done** — mark `[x]`. Remove only if the task was wrong or abandoned; prefer checking off over deleting history.
4. Skip roadmap churn for tiny one-liners (typo, rename, color tweak).

Format:

```md
[ ] short title — one-line description of outcome
```

## Site conventions

- Midnight navy for hero / overview / contact; warm gold accents from the Dar Elkadi logo
- Menu chapters: olive parchment (`--menu-bg` + texture) + black text; islamic pattern between sections
- Menu content + overview/float nav driven by `data/menu.json` (via `js/main.js`)
- Section art: Appetizers `olive_2.png`, Main `olive.png`, Desserts `olive_3.png`, Beverages `jog.png`
- CSS tokens in `:root` (`--gold-rgb`, `--page-x`, `--corner`, etc.); prefer tokens over new hardcoded colors
- Nav: `HOME` · `Menu` (`#menu`) · `Contact` (`#contact`)
- Floating menu after overview: collapsible + draggable; links built from menu sections in `js/main.js`
- Corner ornament: `assets/patterns/islamic_corner.svg`
- No frameworks; keep CSS/JS small and readable
